# Copy to .env at the repo root (docker compose) or paste into the service's
# Variables on Railway. Without Google login nothing else is needed.
#
# No ANTHROPIC_API_KEY: Silos drops inherited ANTHROPIC_*/CLAUDE_CODE_* at boot
# (server/src/inherited-env.ts). Log into Claude once from a Silos console —
# see docs/deploy/railway-template.md (Logging into Claude).

# The UI access secret: https://your-app/?token=<SILOS_TOKEN>
# Generate one: openssl rand -hex 16 (unset = generated into ~/.silos/token)
SILOS_TOKEN=

# Optional: Google login through Silos ID (the only remote sign-in). Leave
# empty if you don't want it — see docs/deploy/railway-template.md.
# SILOS_ID_URL=https://auth.silosplatform.com
# SILOS_OWNER_EMAIL=owner@example.com
# SILOS_PUBLIC_URL=https://silos.example.com
